    "module": {
      "summary": "Child Benefit (General) Regulations 1987 reg 15 — who is responsible for\na child.\n\nPriority cascade:\n  1. Any person already receiving child benefit for the child — they are\n     the responsible person.\n  2. Otherwise, if exactly one claim has been made, the sole claimant.\n  3. Otherwise, the person with whom the child is usually residing.\n\nCounting over the `cb_receipt` relation shows an absence condition\n(count == 0 → no existing recipient)."
    },
